       4. Game Master's Prompt Secret Book (給未來的 Prompt 秘笈 4 大法則): Interactive accordion/cards with actionable tips tailored for young game developers.
       5. Interactive Prompt Simulator Sandbox (Prompt 小試身手練習區): An interactive tool allowing users to practice refining raw ideas into game-ready prompts.
       This structure transforms the retrospective report into an educational gamified learning hub.
  -->
  <!-- Visualization & Content Choices:
       - Evolution Growth Curve -> Line/Radar Chart via Chart.js Canvas -> Visualizes skill & complexity growth -> Confirming Canvas, NO SVG.
       - Stage Comparison Matrix -> Interactive JS Tabs/Cards -> Side-by-side prompt transformation analysis -> Simple vanilla JS interactivity.
       - Element Attribute Breakdown -> Interactive Canvas Pie/Donut Chart -> Shows core combat mechanics -> Dynamic update via Chart.js Canvas.
       - Prompt Sandbox -> Vanilla JS State Form -> Practice converting fuzzy ideas into precise bug fixes -> Pure HTML/CSS/JS.
  -->
  <!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->
