          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">🌱</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">模糊的方向性指令</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">
