            👉 先建骨架，再加肌肉！
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tip 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-md transition flex flex-col justify-between">
